<title>FINLAND: MOST HELIBOR INTEREST RATES LOWER AT FIX.</title>
<headline>MOST HELIBOR INTEREST RATES LOWER AT FIX.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Almost all Helibor rates were</p>
<p>lower at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Friday. The</p>
<p>3-month Helibor rate was down one basis point at 3.08</p>
<p>					  Jan 10 fix	 Jan 9 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor			 3.01 pct	   3.01 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor			 3.04 pct	   3.05 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor			 3.08 pct	   3.09 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor			 3.17 pct	   3.19 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor			 3.25 pct	   3.29 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor			3.34 pct	   3.38 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 240</p>
</text>
